WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:03.140
Huh?

00:03.140 --> 00:05.730
So you don't have a boyfriend now,
Ms. Kinoshita?

00:05.940 --> 00:06.940
Uh, no.

00:07.730 --> 00:09.190
Then how about me?

00:09.190 --> 00:11.280
I'm kind of a catch, you know!

00:11.280 --> 00:12.360
What?

00:15.360 --> 00:18.910
Hey, is that right? That's funny!

00:19.660 --> 00:20.490
Huh?

00:27.330 --> 00:29.710
<i>I set up this group date for you,
remember?</i>

00:29.710 --> 00:32.920
<i>Sorry. Turns out I'm not ready.
I'd like to go home.</i>

00:37.140 --> 00:40.100
Ms. Kinoshita, you're hooked
on some game now, huh?

00:40.470 --> 00:41.560
What's it called?

00:41.560 --> 00:45.350
I'm into mobile gaming too,
so why don't we play together?

00:45.350 --> 00:47.860
Um, it's not for smartphones.

00:48.110 --> 00:51.110
It's a computer game
called Forest of Savior.

00:52.440 --> 00:53.740
Oh.

00:54.740 --> 00:57.240
I, uh...

00:57.240 --> 00:59.700
might have seen the commercial for it.

00:59.700 --> 01:00.580
Yeah.

01:01.240 --> 01:03.580
Uh... yeah.

01:03.870 --> 01:04.870
I saw the commercial!

01:04.870 --> 01:05.960
Sorry about that.

01:05.960 --> 01:07.170
Hey, no wait.

01:07.670 --> 01:09.460
Oh, that one?

01:09.460 --> 01:12.960
Forest, right? Saber, huh? Yeah.

02:43.720 --> 02:46.470
Come on! Are you even trying?

02:46.470 --> 02:50.020
You let a great group date go to waste.
All you did was play with your smartphone!

02:50.390 --> 02:51.770
Are you motivated or not?

02:51.770 --> 02:55.400
Sorry! I got a text from Ruri,
and I couldn't help myself.

02:55.770 --> 02:56.860
Ruri?

02:56.860 --> 02:58.860
Yeah, a friend from FOS.

02:59.240 --> 03:02.280
She's this girl
with the most adorable avatar.

03:02.570 --> 03:03.740
A girl?

03:03.740 --> 03:04.870
What? Yes.

03:06.830 --> 03:09.620
What if it's actually some creepy old guy?

03:10.120 --> 03:12.250
Don't you think it's risky
giving out your number?

03:13.250 --> 03:16.210
I'm pretty sure... she's a girl.

03:16.750 --> 03:18.010
Well, whatever.

03:18.760 --> 03:21.800
I'm heading this way, so see you!

03:28.520 --> 03:29.640
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

03:42.280 --> 03:45.530
<i>I'm picturing her
as a girl in high school.</i>

03:52.160 --> 03:53.670
<i>I wonder what kind of girl she is?</i>

03:55.130 --> 03:55.960
Huh?

03:59.340 --> 04:01.550
<i>Wow. Gothic Lolita?</i>

04:02.010 --> 04:03.930
<i>No, wait. Yumekawa?</i>

04:07.300 --> 04:08.140
<i>You know...</i>

04:08.560 --> 04:10.810
<i>that girl was like Rurihime.</i>

04:13.350 --> 04:16.610
<i>All right! Tomorrow my classes
are in the afternoon,</i>

04:16.610 --> 04:18.900
<i>so I can play
to my heart's content tonight!</i>

04:23.610 --> 04:24.530
Huh?

04:29.370 --> 04:30.700
Oh, well, whatever!

04:33.330 --> 04:36.830
<i>I'm just not ready
for another romance now.</i>

04:40.960 --> 04:41.880
<i>Huh?</i>

04:44.340 --> 04:46.430
<i>There's no one in the guild hall.</i>

04:51.640 --> 04:53.560
<i>It's Rurihime and Yamada!</i>

04:55.270 --> 04:56.810
<i>Wonder what they're up to?</i>

04:57.150 --> 04:59.570
<i>I'd like for the three of us
to go hunting!</i>

05:00.150 --> 05:01.360
<i>Let's see.</i>

05:11.490 --> 05:12.370
<i>Huh?</i>

05:13.700 --> 05:17.120
<i>I wonder if they
don't realize that I'm here?</i>

05:20.920 --> 05:24.880
Doesn't this remind you of when we
first started this guild?

05:25.720 --> 05:26.800
Yeah, I guess.

05:27.430 --> 05:30.550
Back then, it was just
you and me every day, right?

05:32.390 --> 05:34.730
There are so many more members now.

05:35.600 --> 05:36.730
But...

05:36.730 --> 05:38.560
it's nice to be alone once in a while.

05:39.770 --> 05:42.070
Having more time
to live it up with everyone

05:42.070 --> 05:45.440
means there's less time
to be alone with you.

05:45.440 --> 05:47.820
Ruri's kind of missed that, see.

05:50.700 --> 05:55.700
Well, it was easier to get things done
when it was just the two of us.

05:57.580 --> 05:58.420
<i>These...</i>

05:59.830 --> 06:01.130
<i>These two...</i>

06:03.420 --> 06:04.260
<i>they're an item!</i>

06:04.260 --> 06:05.210
Here's the item.

06:05.710 --> 06:07.170
Thank you!

06:07.170 --> 06:09.130
Alchemy skills, so convenient!

06:10.010 --> 06:11.930
Maybe Ruri will try for some too?

06:13.060 --> 06:13.890
By the way...

06:14.310 --> 06:16.560
speaking of other members,
there's one here, you know.

06:16.560 --> 06:17.390
What?

06:17.600 --> 06:20.150
Hey! It's Akanecchi!

06:20.730 --> 06:23.020
I totally missed your login alert!

06:23.020 --> 06:24.940
Sorry, Akanecchi!

06:27.610 --> 06:30.410
What? Of course you're not!

06:34.330 --> 06:36.790
Okay, I need to be somewhere,
so I'm logging out.

06:37.500 --> 06:39.750
Okay! I'll call you later, all right?

06:39.750 --> 06:40.080
<i>Call?</i>

06:40.080 --> 06:40.580
Right.
<i>Call?</i>

06:40.580 --> 06:40.920
Right.

06:44.920 --> 06:46.300
Bye-bye!

06:49.010 --> 06:50.430
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

06:50.970 --> 06:54.260
<i>Yamada never has much to do
with anyone else,</i>

06:54.260 --> 06:56.680
<i>but he's always talking to Rurihime.</i>

06:59.140 --> 07:00.980
<i>Could those two possibly be...</i>

07:01.900 --> 07:03.770
<i>boyfriend and girlfriend?</i>

07:04.730 --> 07:07.740
<i>Just like Takuma and I
started playing together...</i>

07:08.240 --> 07:10.030
<i>maybe Yamada and Rurihime...</i>

07:14.410 --> 07:15.450
Akanecchi?

07:15.740 --> 07:16.740
What?

07:16.740 --> 07:17.950
Are you feeling down?

07:17.950 --> 07:19.330
No, I'm not!

07:23.290 --> 07:24.960
<i>Why am I...</i>

07:28.460 --> 07:30.130
a little depressed?

07:51.900 --> 07:55.910
<i>Why can't I get those two out of my mind?</i>

07:56.700 --> 07:59.540
Social media,
with its power to connect people,

07:59.540 --> 08:03.370
played a role in the movement
known as the Arab Spring,

08:03.370 --> 08:05.880
which started in North Africa.

08:06.380 --> 08:08.670
As you can see from this example,

08:08.670 --> 08:13.590
social media always had this feature,
creating new connections...

08:13.590 --> 08:15.590
<i>Yamada's account...</i>

08:16.510 --> 08:17.890
<i>I want to take a look at it.</i>

08:18.390 --> 08:19.470
<i>But...</i>

08:21.430 --> 08:24.440
<i>that would be like spying on him.</i>

08:25.940 --> 08:27.230
Ms. Kinoshita!

08:28.230 --> 08:29.360
Hey!

08:29.860 --> 08:32.110
<i>Oh, it's that guy from the group date.</i>

08:32.110 --> 08:34.030
<i>What was his name again?</i>

08:35.530 --> 08:38.030
So you were in that class too, huh?

08:38.030 --> 08:40.540
I could see you fiddling
with your smartphone from behind!

08:40.540 --> 08:41.370
No way!

08:41.370 --> 08:43.000
I had no idea!

08:43.000 --> 08:44.960
<i>Your name... Your name...</i>

08:44.960 --> 08:46.670
<i>No good. I can't remember.</i>

08:48.920 --> 08:52.840
By the way, after that group date,
I checked out Forest of Saber.

08:52.840 --> 08:55.050
It's a pretty popular game, huh?

08:55.050 --> 08:55.930
I guess so.

08:56.430 --> 08:58.640
Reading up on it
made me want to try it out!

08:59.220 --> 09:01.140
I mean, I like games and all.

09:01.140 --> 09:03.520
<i>So many guys are into gaming.</i>

09:04.560 --> 09:07.810
Hey, do you play FPS games too?

09:08.020 --> 09:08.860
F?

09:08.860 --> 09:10.820
Do you know the pro gamer, Yamada?

09:11.530 --> 09:14.280
Oh, yeah. Yamada, right?

09:14.780 --> 09:19.620
I might have seen him in a commercial!

09:19.620 --> 09:20.830
Never mind. Sorry.

09:21.200 --> 09:24.250
You really like games, huh, Ms. Kinoshita?

09:24.660 --> 09:26.080
<i>I don't know why...</i>

09:26.420 --> 09:29.290
<i>but for some reason
I've been feeling so rattled.</i>

09:32.210 --> 09:37.130
So listen, the guys in my club are talking
about going to Okinawa this summer.

09:37.130 --> 09:38.840
Really? Sounds fun!

09:39.090 --> 09:42.560
It'll be fun, all right! Because we all
know how to have a good time!

09:43.350 --> 09:44.980
If you want,
you can come with us, Ms. Kinoshita!

09:44.980 --> 09:45.810
<i>Huh?</i>
If you want,
you can come with us, Ms. Kinoshita!

09:45.810 --> 09:45.850
<i>Huh?</i>

09:46.980 --> 09:48.270
<i>That girl, I'm pretty sure...</i>

09:50.020 --> 09:51.570
<i>that I've seen her before.</i>

09:56.030 --> 09:56.990
Thanks for waiting.

10:00.070 --> 10:01.080
Let's go.

10:06.040 --> 10:09.080
The hotel we always stay at
has ocean-view rooms!

10:12.090 --> 10:14.670
<i>I've never had a girlfriend, either.</i>

10:17.680 --> 10:20.720
<i>Well, Yamada's good-looking.</i>

10:21.720 --> 10:26.850
<i>Why wouldn't he
have a girlfriend or two, right?</i>

10:28.640 --> 10:29.690
Ms. Kinoshita?

10:30.270 --> 10:31.110
Huh?

10:31.110 --> 10:33.650
Oh, right. I'm headed that way,
so I'll be going now, okay?

10:33.650 --> 10:34.480
Hey, Ms. Kinoshita?

10:34.480 --> 10:35.480
See you in class!

10:37.860 --> 10:38.990
<i>But why...</i>

10:40.910 --> 10:43.370
<i>Why do I feel so rattled?</i>

11:10.560 --> 11:12.940
<i>Guess I'll pass on logging in tonight.</i>

11:16.110 --> 11:16.940
<i>Who's that?</i>

11:17.440 --> 11:18.690
Momo, maybe?

11:21.280 --> 11:22.490
<i>Rurihime!</i>

11:24.070 --> 11:28.660
<i>What should I do? I'm not really
in the mood to play tonight.</i>

11:33.330 --> 11:34.670
<i>FOS news?</i>

11:35.540 --> 11:39.010
<i>I haven't logged in today,
so no, I haven't.</i>

11:49.390 --> 11:51.230
Ran into him IRL unexpectedly?

11:53.350 --> 11:57.270
<i>Then could it be that that girl
actually was Rurihime?</i>

12:00.280 --> 12:04.320
<i>I did think she had
a real Rurihime vibe going on.</i>

12:06.450 --> 12:09.620
<i>So does that mean... those two are...</i>

13:05.510 --> 13:07.800
All right, guess I'll get ready!

13:10.720 --> 13:13.810
<i>Well, it's rare that you get to meet
your fellow guild members.</i>

13:14.480 --> 13:15.810
<i>It's such a great opportunity!</i>

13:42.380 --> 13:43.510
<i>I'm going to enjoy myself!</i>

13:46.550 --> 13:47.970
<i>Let's see.</i>

13:49.550 --> 13:51.760
<i>The Murata Building,
north of the station...</i>

13:53.430 --> 13:56.350
<i>will be to your left
as you go straight and cross.</i>

13:57.900 --> 13:59.150
<i>And now what?</i>

14:00.310 --> 14:01.860
<i>Let me check the map again.</i>

14:26.970 --> 14:27.800
<i>Where is it?</i>

14:31.220 --> 14:32.050
Whoa!

14:33.310 --> 14:34.850
Hey... sorry about that.

14:36.430 --> 14:37.890
I'll get it for you.

14:37.890 --> 14:40.020
I just hope your phone didn't crack.

14:47.740 --> 14:48.570
What?

14:53.280 --> 14:56.500
Are you playing that game, by any chance?

15:02.420 --> 15:04.000
Since it's pretty casual for a game,

15:04.000 --> 15:06.760
I'd heard that there were
a lot of women playing,

15:06.760 --> 15:10.430
but who would have thought someone
as beautiful as you was playing?

15:10.430 --> 15:11.970
Oh, no. Please!

15:13.470 --> 15:16.310
<i>I'm tagging along because he said
he'd show me the way,</i>

15:16.310 --> 15:18.930
<i>but what if this is a new kind of hustle?</i>

15:19.730 --> 15:23.610
I started playing with a friend of mine,
but we're really into it now,

15:23.610 --> 15:26.030
and we've created our own guild together.

15:26.440 --> 15:29.070
I thought it was just another MMO,

15:29.070 --> 15:31.910
but the game balance
is actually well maintained!

15:32.780 --> 15:37.790
My favorite thing about it is that there's
no inflation fueled by in-game purchases.

15:38.040 --> 15:40.040
Well, the graphics are somewhat outdated,

15:40.040 --> 15:42.420
but they're cute enough
that I can live with that look,

15:42.420 --> 15:44.790
and best of all,
there isn't one dominant race.

15:44.790 --> 15:47.760
Diversity among the races is good,
and as for Job Class discrepancy,

15:47.760 --> 15:49.970
I don't think one Job Class
is better than others.

15:49.970 --> 15:51.680
For now,
it's leaning to the Mage class,

15:51.680 --> 15:54.050
but every update
brings an adjustment,

15:54.050 --> 15:57.060
and thanks to the guild buffs,
our guild battles are meaningful,

15:57.060 --> 15:59.770
so it's totally built
to be party-oriented.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.270
That makes interaction worthwhile,

16:01.270 --> 16:04.560
but by the same token, it can feel
pretty masochistic to power up,

16:04.560 --> 16:06.770
but there's proper speedrunning
at play too.

16:06.770 --> 16:10.190
I can tell that the devs really went
out of their way to reflect user feedback.

16:10.190 --> 16:12.780
It's obvious that they've learned
from their past mistakes.

16:12.780 --> 16:14.120
<i>Thank goodness. He's just a gamer.</i>
It's obvious that they've learned
from their past mistakes.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.070
<i>Thank goodness. He's just a gamer.</i>

16:15.570 --> 16:17.370
So that's my take on it.

16:17.370 --> 16:18.580
- What do you think?
- Huh?

16:19.370 --> 16:20.790
Well, uh...

16:21.750 --> 16:26.290
I'm still just a beginner, so I don't
know as much as the rest of you.

16:27.130 --> 16:31.050
The other day, I got yelled at
for putting trash in the guild's storage.

16:32.010 --> 16:37.220
But the guild master's been so nice,
so I think I really like my guild now.

16:49.440 --> 16:50.940
Oh, I think he's here.

16:51.900 --> 16:55.110
Hey! Over here!

16:55.320 --> 16:57.120
Over here! Over here!

16:57.450 --> 16:58.620
It's this way!

16:58.620 --> 17:00.620
<i>H-Hey. That girl...</i>

17:01.830 --> 17:03.370
<i>is it Rurihime?</i>

17:06.670 --> 17:10.880
So you play that game, Yamada?
Then let's go one-on-one sometime.

17:10.880 --> 17:12.170
Sure.

17:14.010 --> 17:15.430
Yamada!

17:17.850 --> 17:19.640
Yamada! Long time no see!

17:19.640 --> 17:20.890
It's been a while.

17:20.890 --> 17:21.970
Things going okay?

17:21.970 --> 17:22.810
I'd say fair.

17:23.100 --> 17:24.270
Fair, huh?

17:30.190 --> 17:32.360
Um, you must be Rurihime, right?

17:32.360 --> 17:33.690
Nice to meet you!

17:34.240 --> 17:37.320
You look just like your character,
so I knew right away that it was you!

17:37.530 --> 17:39.450
Thanks for your text this morning!

17:49.130 --> 17:55.050
<i>Hold on. She seems a little different
than she is in-game.</i>

17:57.300 --> 17:59.720
Um... uh...

18:01.310 --> 18:04.020
Listen, Eita... who is this?

18:04.230 --> 18:05.480
Most likely...

18:07.810 --> 18:10.190
Akanecchi! Right?

19:59.260 --> 20:00.340
Huh?

20:00.340 --> 20:02.510
Uh, everyone, why don't we
all go inside for now?

20:18.280 --> 20:20.360
We're finally here.

20:24.450 --> 20:25.910
Ouch.

20:28.160 --> 20:30.660
Freaking heavy!

20:38.090 --> 20:39.170
I'm exhausted.

20:46.350 --> 20:47.470
Oh, crap.

20:57.570 --> 21:00.570
<i>You're late! Where were you?</i>

21:01.030 --> 21:02.650
<i>We're all waiting on you, you know.</i>

21:02.650 --> 21:06.570
Sorry. The thing is,
one thing led to another...

21:06.990 --> 21:09.830
and now there's a strange woman
sleeping in my apartment.

21:10.410 --> 21:11.250
Huh?

21:13.790 --> 21:15.830
<i>A-A woman, did you say?</i>

21:15.830 --> 21:18.130
<i>- Did you say, "Woman"?
- Absolutely unforgiveable...</i>

21:18.130 --> 21:20.920
<i>He said, "Woman," right? Right? Woman?</i>

21:20.920 --> 21:23.720
<i>I need you to explain
exactly how this strange woman</i>

21:23.720 --> 21:25.590
<i>ended up asleep in your apartment.</i>

21:25.890 --> 21:28.140
<i>Hey, photos! I want to see a photo!</i>

21:28.140 --> 21:31.600
<i>I swear I won't post them!
I'm pretty internet-savvy, all right?</i>

21:31.600 --> 21:32.730
Not happening.

21:32.730 --> 21:34.810
<i>I'm your teammate! Trust me!</i>

21:38.480 --> 21:40.360
I feel sick.

21:40.520 --> 21:44.150
<i>Present a sketch to us.
Then thy sin shall be forgiven.</i>

21:44.150 --> 21:45.360
I'm stepping away for a sec.

21:45.360 --> 21:47.030
<i>H-Hey, Yamada! Hold up!</i>

21:47.950 --> 21:50.780
<i>Now I'm pissed,
so I'm gonna trash your account.</i>

21:50.780 --> 21:51.620
Not happening.

21:51.620 --> 21:52.660
<i>Low literacy.</i>

21:56.080 --> 21:58.330
Uh, are you all right?

22:03.050 --> 22:04.970
Do you want some water?

22:11.640 --> 22:12.470
No, I don't.

22:16.310 --> 22:21.770
You don't like me anymore, do you?

22:24.570 --> 22:28.110
So just go away somewhere now.

22:29.780 --> 22:31.280
Just go!

22:32.450 --> 22:34.160
<i>Telling me to go...</i>

22:34.660 --> 22:36.330
<i>while clinging to me...</i>

22:36.960 --> 22:38.120
<i>isn't that a contradiction?</i>

22:39.040 --> 22:42.960
<i>Seems that way to me,
but it's probably not what I think.</i>

22:43.380 --> 22:44.880
<i>I have no clue.</i>

22:53.970 --> 22:57.770
<i>But if I move now...</i>

22:59.730 --> 23:03.520
<i>I have a feeling
that she'll cry even harder.</i>

23:16.660 --> 23:18.830
<i>She's been crying nonstop.</i>

23:19.750 --> 23:21.210
<i>How miserable can she be?</i>

23:25.550 --> 23:26.920
<i>I guess...</i>

23:26.920 --> 23:30.300
<i>it's rough, huh?
This thing called romance.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:37.060
<i>You can sleep in peace till morning.</i>

23:38.680 --> 23:39.520
I'm gonna puke!
